  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save dogs in the Agadir City Pound from Starvation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2020 shocking images of starving dogs held in the cities dog pound shocked animal lovers all over the world.  We are the only organisation who are actively working to make sure these scenes are never repeated.  Each month we deliver 3000 USD of food to the dogs in the pound to save them from starving.  We also pay for extra staff to make sure the animals are looked after and visit regularly to rescue the very young or old dogs, as well as those injured or sick.</narrative>
  </description>
